Project structure
Always create separate folder for backend and frontend and other services
Before Implementing a code section, search codebase for any reusable component/hook or anything reusable 
Always use named import like
"export const"
In frontend:
-- Use the following structure in src
----- components folder for reusable components
----- hooks folder for reusable hooks
----- containers folder for business logic using components
----- types folder for type definitions
----- utils folder for reusable funtions
----- pages folders for calling container components and are used in routes
----- routes folder for routing
Always create a page mobile responsive
In Backend
------ Use .graphql for typeDefs
